  "file": "Documentation/Enhancements/Ollama_Autonomy_Issue_List.md",
  "line": 8,
  "text": "FIX: | OA-02    | Build MCP task router backlog       | Add `mcp_task_router.py` plus persistence under `Shared/AutomationState/` to convert inbound issues/webhooks into structured tasks with priority metadata.                 | Complete    | Router operational; backlog persistence confirmed; `/backlog_queue` endpoint enqueues entries; controller auto-queues planned items every 15s (verified via 6min soak test); tasks execute via ci-check commands. Backlog status sync from task completion may need tuning for long-running commands.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |",
  "source": "md_issue"
}
{
  "file": "Documentation/Enhancements/Ollama_Autonomy_Issue_List.md",
  "line": 11,
  "text": "FIX: | OA-05    | Add AI review and guarded merge     | Create reviewer workflow that summarizes diffs via `Shared/OllamaIntegrationFramework.swift` and enforces merge safeguards (lint/build/test artifacts required).           | Complete    | ✅ All features implemented (2025-10-05): ai_code_review.sh with Ollama codellama model for diff analysis; merge_guard.sh with 3-layer safety checks (validation/MCP/AI review); GitHub workflow (.github/workflows/ai-code-review.yml) with PR automation; MCP integration for alerts; structured review output (quality/security/performance/bugs); approval status (APPROVED/NEEDS_CHANGES/BLOCKED); commit status checks; comprehensive documentation (OA-05_Implementation_Summary.md, AI_CODE_REVIEW_GUIDE.md, GITHUB_TOKEN_SCOPE_ANALYSIS.md). Security: Status-check approach chosen (safest); opt-in auto-merge documented but not implemented; full permission analysis complete. Testing: All scripts tested locally; workflow ready for PR testing. |",
  "source": "md_issue"
}
