  "line": 375,
  "text": "ACTION: **\"Timeout\" Indicator:** The comment `// Test generation timeout` suggests an automated process failed. This could be due to an infinite loop, excessive complexity in the source (`test_lines.swift`), or an underpowered generation environment.",
