}
{
  "file": "Tools/Automation/agents/backups/CodingReviewer_20251009_190645/AI_CODE_REVIEW_20250924.md",
  "line": 379,
  "text": "ACTION: **Investigate the Generation Failure:** Immediately address the root cause of the timeout. Examine the source file `test_lines.swift`. Is it extremely long, highly complex, or does it contain patterns that might confuse an AI test generator (e.g., massive classes, unclear function boundaries)?",
  "source": "md_recommendation"
}
{
  "file": "Tools/Automation/agents/backups/CodingReviewer_20251009_190645/AI_CODE_REVIEW_20250924.md",
  "line": 389,
  "text": "ACTION: **Break Down the Source:** If `test_lines.swift` is a large file, consider refactoring it into smaller, more focused components (e.g., multiple structs/classes in different files). This will make both automated and manual testing easier.",
  "source": "md_recommendation"
}
{
  "file": "Tools/Automation/agents/backups/CodingReviewer_20251009_190645/AI_CODE_REVIEW_20250924.md",
  "line": 425,
  "text": "ACTION: **Test Design:** The comment does not indicate what testing strategy was attempted (e.g., Unit Tests, Integration Tests). This suggests a lack of a clear testing strategy.",
  "source": "md_recommendation"
}
{
  "file": "Tools/Automation/agents/backups/CodingReviewer_20251009_190645/AI_CODE_REVIEW_20250924.md",
  "line": 429,
  "text": "ACTION: **Don't Rely Solely on AI Generation:** Treat AI-generated tests as a **first draft only**. They should be heavily reviewed, curated, and added to. The best tests often require human understanding of intent, edge cases, and mock data.",
  "source": "md_recommendation"
}
{
  "file": "Tools/Automation/agents/backups/CodingReviewer_20251009_190645/AI_CODE_REVIEW_20250924.md",
  "line": 461,
  "text": "ACTION: **RE-EVALUATE THE TOOL:** Consider if this AI test generation tool is reliable enough for your project. It may be suitable for generating boilerplate but should not be trusted to create a complete test suite without human intervention.",
  "source": "md_recommendation"
}
