  "text": "ACTION: **Run the Test Suite:** Execute it and see if it passes. More importantly, see if it _fails correctly_ when you intentionally break the implementation in `debug_engine.swift`. This validates that the tests are actually effective.",
  "source": "md_recommendation"
}
