{
  "file": "Tools/Automation/agents/backups/CodingReviewer_20251009_185754/CodingReviewer_20250930_162632/CodingReviewer/CodingReviewer/CodingReviewer/AI_CODE_REVIEW_20250924.md",
  "line": 535,
  "text": "ACTION: **Create a new `XCTestCase` subclass** (e.g., `LoginUITests`).",
