  "line": 39,
  "text": "FIX: 2. Code Quality Issues: The code quality issues in this file can be improved by following Swift best practices. For example, there is a lack of spaces between variables and keywords like \"for\" or \"if.\" This will make the code more readable and easier to maintain. Additionally, variable names should be descriptive and concise.",
