  "line": 42,
  "text": "ACTION: Swift Best Practices Violations: The code violates several best practices in the Swift language. One example would be using `print` statements instead of logging libraries, which makes it harder to manage logs and search through them. Additionally, there are no comments on the purpose or usage of the variables used in the test.",
