  "line": 24,
  "text": "ACTION: Upgrade to a newer version of Swift: The project is currently using Swift 5.0, which is a relatively recent version of the language. Consider upgrading to a newer version of Swift (e.g., Swift 5.4) for improved performance and feature support.",
