{
  "file": "Tools/Automation/agents/backups/CodingReviewer_20251015_114501/AI_CODE_REVIEW_20251013.md",
  "line": 23,
  "text": "FIX: * The `SwiftPMXCTestObserver` class is a singleton, which means that only one instance of the class can exist at any given time. This could lead to issues if multiple test bundles need to be observed simultaneously. It would be better to design the class as a non-singleton class that can be instantiated multiple times for different test bundles.",
  "source": "md_issue"
}
{
