  "line": 30,
  "text": "ACTION: Security Vulnerabilities: There is a security vulnerability that needs to be addressed.  The file contains a comment from an automated process. It is recommended to remove or update the comment to prevent possible security risks associated with it.",
  "source": "md_recommendation"
}
{
  "file": "Tools/Automation/agents/backups/CodingReviewer_20251015_114501/AI_CODE_REVIEW_20251013.md",
  "line": 39,
  "text": "ACTION: Code Quality Issues: The code quality issues in this file can be improved by following Swift best practices. For example, there is a lack of spaces between variables and keywords like \"for\" or \"if.\" This will make the code more readable and easier to maintain. Additionally, variable names should be descriptive and concise.",
  "source": "md_recommendation"
}
{
  "file": "Tools/Automation/agents/backups/CodingReviewer_20251015_114501/AI_CODE_REVIEW_20251013.md",
  "line": 39,
  "text": "FIX: 2. Code Quality Issues: The code quality issues in this file can be improved by following Swift best practices. For example, there is a lack of spaces between variables and keywords like \"for\" or \"if.\" This will make the code more readable and easier to maintain. Additionally, variable names should be descriptive and concise.",
