  "line": 41,
  "text": "ACTION: Security Vulnerabilities: Currently, there is no validation or encoding performed on user-supplied input, which could lead to security vulnerabilities if user input is not properly sanitized. It's recommended to use a library like SnapKit or HandyJSON for JSON encoding and decoding.",
  "source": "md_recommendation"
}
{
